Support normal terminal keys:

- Enter
- Backspace
- Delete
- Tab
- Arrow keys
- Home
- End
- Page Up
- Page Down
- Ctrl+C
- Ctrl+D
- Ctrl+Z
- Ctrl+L
- Ctrl+R
- Ctrl+Shift+C
- Ctrl+Shift+V

A command-entry field separate from the terminal output is not enough for standard terminal behavior.

