> **A PTY-backed, persistent-shell terminal emulator using a mature terminal widget.**

Everything else should be built around that.

The most important architectural shift is to stop treating normal shell commands as one-off process executions and instead make the application host a real terminal session. Once that is solid, theming, AI, persistent settings, documentation, and packaging become much easier and safer to build.

