# Agent execution model

## The AI should never directly execute invisible commands

All commands should be visible and auditable.

Every AI command should go through a controlled executor:

```plain text
AI proposes command
  ↓
ZetaTerminal classifies risk
  ↓
User approves if required
  ↓
Command is sent to terminal/session
  ↓
Output is captured
  ↓
Output is returned to AI
```


This gives the user confidence and prevents hidden system modifications.

