# Critical implementation rules

## Rule 1: Terminal must work without AI

If Ollama is missing or the model fails, ZetaTerminal should still be a good terminal.

---

## Rule 2: AI must not bypass user trust

All actions should be visible.

High-risk actions must require confirmation.

---

## Rule 3: AI execution should be interruptible

There must be a clear:

```plain text
