Cancel Task
Kill Running Command
```


---

## Rule 4: Separate human terminal from AI executor

Do not let AI accidentally type into the user’s active shell unless explicitly requested.

---

## Rule 5: Prefer diagnosis before remediation

The AI should not jump straight to “fix” commands.

It should inspect first.

